  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>log</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mfrac><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>300</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>310</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math> .......(i)<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>log</mi><mo>&#160;&#160;2</mo><mo>=2</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>300</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math> ......(ii)<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></msub></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>300</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>300</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>310</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>300</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>310</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>300</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>310</mn></mrow><mn>610</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>304.92</mn></math></p><p>Hence, the temperature of reaction B should be increased from <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>300</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></math> by&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>304</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>92</mn><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>300</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>92</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></math>.</p></blockquote>",
